# Cloudflare Pages automatically serves `page.html` at `/page` and 308-redirects
# `/page.html` → `/page`. Do NOT add `/path /path.html 200` rewrites — those fight
# the extensionless redirect and cause ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS (seen on /collections).
#
# Pretty single-collection URLs rewrite to the extensionless collection page.
# Target must NOT include `.html` or Pages will 308 again and drop the handle.
/collections/:handle /collection?handle=:handle 200
